    - target: {fileID: 6618229677056908224, guid: ed381a3717aaaa74091311915fabf695, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'IT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE AN EAZY JOB

        JUST LET THE AI DO ITS THING
        AND SIT BACK

        NO AI EVER FUCKS UP NAVIGATION

        JUST ANOTHER
        TRIP AND I GET TO GO HOME

        WITH A FAT DECK OF CREDS

        BUT
        NO, I FAKED MY RESULTS!

        IM NO AUXILARY NAVIGATOR!

        WHO NEEDS
        THOSE ANYWAY THESE DAYS?!?!?

        AND NOW THE AI FUCKS UP

        AND
        NOW I DONT CATCH IT

        AND NOW THIS UNIVERSE DARES

        TO PLAY
        SOME KARMA ON ME?!?!?!

        WHY NOT THE MEN WHO KILL MEN?!?!

        WHY
        NOT THE MEN WHO SUCK UP OUR PAY?!?!?!

        WHY ME?!!?!?!?!

'
